  "title": "Make-Ahead Manicotti",
  "description": "This make-ahead manicotti is stuffed with a tasty blend of spinach, Parmesan, and mozzarella, and topped with store-bought spaghetti sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Sandir"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-04-09T15:16:27-04:00",
